3. Leonardo da Vinci, ready to discuss his visionary ideas about art and science, including his inventions and works like the Mona Lisa and The Last Supper;

The evening is sure to be filled with thought-provoking discussions, intellectual debates, and a deep exploration of the human condition and its connection to the physical world.
